      "body": "# Bug report\r\n\r\nMRE:\r\n```py\r\nclass D(dict):\r\n  pass\r\n\r\nclass S(set):\r\n  pass\r\n\r\nclass L(list):\r\n  pass\r\n\r\nclass T(tuple):\r\n  pass\r\n\r\nclass S_(str):\r\n  pass\r\n\r\nprint(repr(dict({\"a\": 1})))\r\nprint(repr(D({\"a\": 1})))\r\nprint(repr(set([1, 2])))\r\nprint(repr(S([1, 2])))\r\nprint(repr(list([1, 2])))\r\nprint(repr(L([1, 2])))\r\nprint(repr(tuple([1, 2])))\r\nprint(repr(T([1, 2])))\r\nprint(repr(str([1, 2])))\r\nprint(repr(S_([1, 2])))\r\n```\r\n\r\nOutput:\r\n```py\r\n{'a': 1}\r\n{'a': 1}\r\n{1, 2}\r\nS({1, 2})\r\n[1, 2]\r\n[1, 2]\r\n(1, 2)\r\n(1, 2)\r\n'[1, 2]'\r\n'[1, 2]'\r\n```\r\n\r\n# Your environment\r\n\r\n- CPython versions tested on: 3.10.6, 3.11.2\r\n\r\n",
